HiLITE Cyber Tower is a next-generation IT development strategically located within Cyberpark, Calicut. Designed to strengthen North Kerala’s position in India’s growing technology landscape, the project spans approximately 9 lakh sq. ft. across 2.5 acres of land. The tower is envisioned as a future-ready IT hub that will accommodate multinational corporations, high-growth startups, innovation labs, and R&D centres within an advanced infrastructure framework.



