YOO Hub Trivandrum by HiLITE Group is Kerala’s first branded IT Park, developed at Technopark Phase III, Thiruvananthapuram. Spanning 5.18 lakh sq. ft. across 1.88 acres of land, the development comprises 18 floors. The project marks YOO’s first dedicated IT Park globally, bringing internationally recognised, design-led excellence into Kerala’s evolving technology ecosystem. The development is expected to generate around 4,000 direct IT jobs, strengthening regional employment and supporting talent development.
